sequenceDiagram
  participant cw as cw friction triage
  participant reports as reports.ts
  participant gh as GitHub (gh)
  participant triage as triage.ts
  participant haiku as Haiku 5.5
  participant repo as Checkout (readTools)
  cw->>reports: triageReport(number)
  reports->>gh: view the report, list open and closed reports
  reports->>triage: decide(report, open, closed)
  triage->>haiku: prompt with CLAUDE.md, friction.md, the reports
  loop up to 8 steps, about $0.10
    haiku->>repo: read_file, list_files, search
    repo-->>haiku: file text, paths, matches
  end
  Note over triage,haiku: last step, or the cap spent: no tools, so it answers
  haiku-->>triage: decision, fixed_in, reason, brief
  triage-->>reports: the decision and what it checked
  reports->>gh: label, comment or close (triageActions)
